<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Liham para kay Jaymee</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #1a1614;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#2c2420 1px, transparent 0);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
      font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      user-select: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Letter Container */
    .letter-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 550px;
      min-height: 650px;
      perspective: 1000px;
    }

    /* Crumpled Paper Effect */
    .paper {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: #f4e8c1;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.15)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 100%),
        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.03) 0px, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.03) 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 4px);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 
        0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
        inset 0 0 50px rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid #d4c391;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.8s ease-in-out;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transform: scale(0.9) rotate(-1deg);
    }

    /* Folded Cover */
    .folded-cover {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: #e6d5a7;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), rgba(0,0,0,0.15));
      border: 1px solid #c5b282;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 10;
      transition: all 0.8s ease-in-out;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Crease lines */
    .folded-cover::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: 
        linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 49%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 50%, transparent 51%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 49%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 50%, transparent 51%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .wax-seal {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      background: #8b0000;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #a52a2a, #5c0000);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      color: #d4af37;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), inset 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border: 2px dashed #6b0000;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .click-hint {
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      color: #5c4a37;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* Text Typography */
    .content {
      color: #2c1d11;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    blockquote {
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 15px 0;
      padding-left: 15px;
      border-left: 2px solid #8b4513;
      color: #4a3525;
    }

    .page-number {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 15px;
      right: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #8b6b4d;
      font-family: sans-serif;
    }

    /* Animation State Classes */
    .paper.active {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);
    }

    .folded-cover.open {
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transform: translateY(-100px) rotateX(90deg);
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="letter-container">
    
    <!-- FOLDED COVER -->
    <div class="folded-cover" id="cover">
      <div class="wax-seal">J</div>
      <div class="click-hint">Click to open</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 1 -->
    <div class="paper" id="page1">
      <div class="content">
        <p>Sa pelikulang <i>The Notebook</i>, nag-umpisa ito sa isang kasabihan:</p>
        
        <blockquote>
          “I am nothing special, of this I am sure. I am a common man with common thoughts and I’ve led a common life. There are no monuments dedicated to me and my name will soon be forgotten, but I’ve loved another with all my heart and soul, and to me, this has always been enough…”
        </blockquote>

        <p>Samantalang sinimulan ni Noah ang kanyang liham sa “My Dearest Allie…”.</p>

        <p>Datapwat, ang liham na ito ay magsisimula sa…</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-number">Pahina 1 (Click to continue)</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 2 -->
    <div class="paper" id="page2">
      <div class="content">
        <p><strong>My Dearest Jaymee,</strong></p>
        
        <p>It’s been a long time nung huli tayong nag-usap—maybe almost 4 months na. Chill ka lang, hindi ito isang liham para hingin ang matamis mong “oo.” Isa itong pormal na kasulatan para makasama ka sa takilya at Intrams bukas.</p>

        <p>Lately, I feel na nagiging cold na ang convo natin, maybe dahil parehas tayong busy. But I just want to ask na sana pumayag ka na bukas na makasama kita. I know na hindi pa kita totally kabisado, pero alam kong para pumayag ka, kailangan kang pilitin.</p>

        <p>Sa una nating paglabas noong Hulyo 17, napansin ko na 'yun, at napatunayan ko noong pangalawa nating paglabas noong Hulyo 28. Kaya ngayon, muli kitang inaanyayahan na sana makasama naman kita sa takilya bukas. Wala ka ring magagawa kasi 'pag hindi ka pumayag, magiging makulit ako at pipilitin talaga kita.</p>

        <p class="signature">Sincerely yours,<br><strong>Chrisnel</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-number">Pahina 2</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    let currentState = 0;

    const cover = document.getElementById('cover');
    const page1 = document.getElementById('page1');
    const page2 = document.getElementById('page2');

    document.body.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (currentState === 0) {
        cover.classList.add('open');
        page1.classList.add('active');
        currentState = 1;
      } else if (currentState === 1) {
        page1.classList.remove('active');
        page2.classList.add('active');
        currentState = 2;
      }
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
